# Travel Agent - booking and business travel services
# Updated: 2026-11-22
# Policy-free rule list. Recommended initial caller policy: DIRECT.
# Separate from TravelApp hotel/airline rules. Caller policy selects DIRECT or Region-AP.
# Eight identified services; portal-domain baseline, not complete mobile API coverage.
# Journal stays with existing Apple/iCloud routing.
# App labelled Travel is excluded at the user's request.
# Only the visible folder page is included.

# Booking.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,booking.com

# Expedia
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,expedia.com
# Exact image/asset host referenced by the official Expedia portal.
DOMAIN,a.travel-assets.com

# Navan
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,navan.com

# Amex Travel
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,amextravel.com
# Official Amex Travel portal redirects here. This host also serves non-travel pages.
DOMAIN,www.americanexpress.com

# Tripadvisor
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,tripadvisor.com

